{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "bc46c15d8ee58ecd",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "🔁 1. Ask for a recipe",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 1900,
			"height": 520
		},
		{
			"id": "ffec51a3310662d2",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "🔁 2. Save a favourite",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 680,
			"width": 1520,
			"height": 260
		},
		{
			"id": "dce7dc1c3c2fa94b",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "🔁 3. Monday stats",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1100,
			"width": 1900,
			"height": 260
		},
		{
			"id": "0466aec7a81f2ef2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**▶ Starts when**\nA member writes `!cook eggs, spinach, feta`",
			"x": 50,
			"y": 50,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 180,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "10d200811341b17b",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**1. 👤 [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/People/Server member|Server member]]**\nwrites !cook with their ingredients\n➜ [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Parts/Message router|Message router]]: message",
			"x": 430,
			"y": 50,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 180,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "631d6463e86f8e3d",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**2. 🧩 [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Parts/Cost guard|Cost guard]]**\nchecks they have asked fewer than 20 times today",
			"x": 810,
			"y": 50,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 180
		},
		{
			"id": "176602269c9bfc9f",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**3. 🧩 [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Parts/Ingredient reader|Ingredient reader]]**\ncleans the list and drops duplicates\n➜ [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Parts/Recipe writer|Recipe writer]]: ingredient list",
			"x": 1190,
			"y": 50,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 180
		},
		{
			"id": "0fb813ed965c57bf",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**4. 🧩 [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Parts/Recipe writer|Recipe writer]]**\nasks Claude for three recipes\n➜ [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Outside Services/Claude API|Claude API]]: prompt",
			"x": 1570,
			"y": 50,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 180
		},
		{
			"id": "220773f48243be1e",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**5. 🧩 [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Parts/Recipe writer|Recipe writer]]**\nsaves the request and the answer\n➜ [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Storage/Request history|Request history]]",
			"x": 1570,
			"y": 310,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 160
		},
		{
			"id": "a3649ff2bf0ccc6a",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**6. 🧩 [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Parts/Reply formatter|Reply formatter]]**\nposts each recipe in a thread\n➜ [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Outputs/Recipe thread|Recipe thread]]",
			"x": 1190,
			"y": 310,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 160
		},
		{
			"id": "70e0d2fa8c5c0575",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**■ Ends with**\nThree recipes in a thread under the member's message",
			"x": 810,
			"y": 310,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "a5ae8f64560a2b56",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**▶ Starts when**\nA member replies `!fav` to one of the bot's recipes",
			"x": 50,
			"y": 730,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "45eaebc6db5cc243",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**1. 👤 [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/People/Server member|Server member]]**\nreplies !fav to a recipe\n➜ [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Parts/Message router|Message router]]",
			"x": 430,
			"y": 730,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "b3b1e591dea9fe3c",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**2. 🧩 [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Parts/Favourites keeper|Favourites keeper]]**\nsaves the recipe under the member's name\n➜ [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Storage/Request history|Request history]]: favourite",
			"x": 810,
			"y": 730,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 160
		},
		{
			"id": "8e6a98a74462889d",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**■ Ends with**\nThe recipe is saved (there is no way to list favourites yet)",
			"x": 1190,
			"y": 730,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "2f22e4e29643b840",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**▶ Starts when**\nMonday, 9:00",
			"x": 50,
			"y": 1150,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "ca25bfcb2bfa2358",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**1. 📥 [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Inputs/Monday timer|Monday timer]]**\nfires\n➜ [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Parts/Weekly stats|Weekly stats]]",
			"x": 430,
			"y": 1150,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "3564b680f57aea24",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**2. 🧩 [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Parts/Weekly stats|Weekly stats]]**\nreads last week's requests\n➜ [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Storage/Request history|Request history]]",
			"x": 810,
			"y": 1150,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 160
		},
		{
			"id": "15ca5a2a7aef8f60",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**3. 🧩 [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Parts/Weekly stats|Weekly stats]]**\nposts the ten most-used ingredients\n➜ [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Outputs/Monday post|Monday post]]",
			"x": 1190,
			"y": 1150,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 160
		},
		{
			"id": "7b422e50f06c7c3f",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**■ Ends with**\nA post in #kitchen",
			"x": 1570,
			"y": 1150,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "99c423b4e80541b2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "# Pantry Chef\n**2 Flows**\n\nA Discord bot that suggests dinner recipes from whatever is in your fridge.\n\nAtlas: [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Pantry Chef|Pantry Chef]] · [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/1 Big Picture.canvas|1 Big Picture]] · [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/3 What If.canvas|3 What If]] · [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/4 Plan vs Reality.canvas|4 Plan vs Reality]]",
			"x": 0,
